fixture zone1_02_dash_jump_route
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 2 "Dash-jump: carry dash speed into a jump. Taught by a gap exactly one dash-jump wide"; s5 Dash "Jump during frames 5 to 9 keeps 100% dash speed"; docs/adr/0010 (Dash-jump); the same route as tech02_dash_jump_frame5_air_dash, from the west door
room zone1/02_dash_jump
spawn 74 608
frames 246
input
  # The ditch (the safe first encounter): a running jump across it, held to its top.
  0..29 R
  30..41 R jump
  42..99 R
  # The island's run-up, then the dash at the near edge and the jump on dash frame 5, as in the
  # tech 2 fixture, then the air jump on the way down and the air dash.
  100 R dash
  101..103 R
  104..134 R jump
  135 R
  136..177 R jump
  178 R U jump dash
  179..215 R jump
  # On the far ledge: run to the east door.
  216..245 R
end
expect
  at 30 event.jump=1
  at 100 event.dash=1
  at 104 event.jump=1 vx=5120
  at 136 event.air_jump=1
  at 178 event.dash=1
  never 0..245 event.hazard=1
  # Over the 1664 u of pit (it ends at 2720 u) and onto the east ledge, then through the east door.
